  "label": "User projected onto the scene as the speaker of the angry declaration",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene 'angry_bulldog_declaration' where the bulldog is visually mapped as the speaker of the text 'i am never drinking with you fuckers ever again!'. The user identifies with the bulldog's defiant expression and the confrontational tone of the text, projecting themselves as the one making this declaration. The deictic 'you' in the text targets the audience/user, while the bulldog's expression serves as the visual embodiment of the user's projected anger and rejection.",
